\date{2025-11-13T18:27:37Z}
\title{Inventory union}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{We define the union of [inventories](0012), #{I \cup J}, as the inventory \lam{e}{I(e) + J(e)}, the componentwise sum of inventories #{I} and #{J}.  Inventories form a monoid under union, with the empty inventory as the identity element.}
